name=Fate Token - Multiplayer Permadeath
id=PermadeathLock
authors=kendubu1
description=Multiplayer permadeath, with one way back. When a player dies they go on a death list and cannot return with a new character. A Fate Token buys back one death and keeps the skills the dead character earned - and a token bound to a place brings you back there. Admins pardon, revive and hand out tokens from an in-game panel (/permadeath ui) or from chat. Dedicated servers and co-op Host games; single player is left alone by design.
